<gpx version="1.1" creator="SkipperCast" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><metadata><name>SC26-075-C habitat research</name></metadata><wpt lat="35.399049" lon="-120.87812"><name>SC26-075-C</name><desc>Morro Bay rough reef Mapped rough-rock high; 3.9 m relief across 210 m. Terrain C 22/100; not catch probability. Center 47 ft; nearby 43–57 ft MLLW. Survey-derived habitat candidate; no verified catch at this coordinate. No verified charter identity match in the reviewed AIS sample; no AIS-confirmed hotspot. Survey 2008; screen 2026-09-20. No additional flag from this depth and closure screening. Subtle local relief in the rendered grid; primarily a mapped-bottom investigation option. Check current regulations, closures, conditions and sounder depths.</desc><link href="https://doi.org/10.5066/P9HEZNRO"/><sym>Fishing Area</sym></wpt><trk><name>SC-AREA-055</name><desc>Partial nearby mapped rough-rock/bedrock footprint, clipped within 350 m of retained targets and by depth/closure screening; not the complete reef or an individual pile.</desc><trkseg><trkpt lat="35.399551447133575" lon="-120.87849178009712"/><trkpt lat="35.39946714094727" lon="-120.87882428930668"/><trkpt lat="35.39874628899869" lon="-120.87884317823553"/><trkpt lat="35.3982880229066" lon="-120.87841479294862"/><trkpt lat="35.398276419537815" lon="-120.87775450747273"/><trkpt lat="35.39890716460182" lon="-120.87773797150452"/><trkpt lat="35.3995456459315" lon="-120.87816163214511"/><trkpt lat="35.399551447133575" lon="-120.87849178009712"/></trkseg></trk></gpx>
